Individual interviewees were also asked whether their CFMG has a grievance and redress mechanism. @tbl-bs_individual_grievance shows the percentage reporting this broken down by interviewee role and as can be seen most stated that there was a mechanism in place. However, minority of around 10-20% stated that the CFMG lacked any such process. The differences among interviewee roles were not significant.


